    "detailed_description": "A land of discoveries awaits you. Traverse the beautiful Scottish scenery of A Bonnie Odyssey, an open world sci-fi adventure set on a retrofuturist island in the Highlands. Play as Zoe, a young woman returning to her childhood home to find answers and unravel the mystery of her missing father. With her trusty robot companion Juno in tow, Zoe will uncover a vibrant world full of puzzles, surprises, and the secrets to her own past.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore: Discover the mysteries of your home at your own pace. Rediscover abandoned buildings claimed by nature, and help the remaining island residents on their own journeys<br></li><li>Solve puzzles: Make your way through the wilds of this forgotten island by solving an array of puzzles through using your own wits and hints form the environment around you<br></li><li>Uncover secrets: Dive into Zoe\u2019s story and connect with her past to find answers to questions that have lived with her throughout her life</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "A land of discoveries awaits you. Traverse the beautiful Scottish scenery of A Bonnie Odyssey, an open world sci-fi adventure set on a retrofuturist island in the Highlands. Play as Zoe, a young woman returning to her childhood home to find answers and unravel the mystery of her missing father. With her trusty robot companion Juno in tow, Zoe will uncover a vibrant world full of puzzles, surprises, and the secrets to her own past.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore: Discover the mysteries of your home at your own pace. Rediscover abandoned buildings claimed by nature, and help the remaining island residents on their own journeys<br></li><li>Solve puzzles: Make your way through the wilds of this forgotten island by solving an array of puzzles through using your own wits and hints form the environment around you<br></li><li>Uncover secrets: Dive into Zoe\u2019s story and connect with her past to find answers to questions that have lived with her throughout her life</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A Bonnie Odyssey is a retrofuturist puzzle mystery where you\u2019ll explore an enigmatic abandoned island. This open world sci-fi adventure in the Scottish wilds tells the tale of a father and daughter separated by time, unravel the secrets of your past, and meet odd little friends along the way.",
